# Kernels the reduced ONNX Runtime build keeps: every operator of the ONNX provider's models (OnnxModelArtifacts) as
# published and as ORT_ENABLE_ALL optimizes them for arm64-v8a, armeabi-v7a and x86_64 CPUs, which adds fused
# com.microsoft kernels and, on x86_64, the NCHWc layout kernels. Regenerate it whenever a model is added or changed;
# see build-aar.sh.
